  "_roles_comment": "Per-role staffing defaults (issue #1021, KTD10). Each role names the work shape its tier comes from and the rated capability its candidate executors are ranked by. The role vocabulary itself is the software-development-lifecycle repository's (issue #1022): this block holds staffing defaults for the roles the run chain uses, and an unknown role name fails loud rather than falling back to a work shape. functional-tester maps onto the debug capability because the registry rates no capability called testing, and functional testing against a real environment is iterative tool-driven diagnosis.",
